# The library books Owen Thadd takes in the Undercity's Magic Quarter: each
# book is an item looted from a book on a table or shelf, and Owen offers its
# quest (same title as the book) while it is in your bags. Friend of the
# Library (78150) follows the first books.
#
# Sources: the quests, their faction and who takes them from data/forever
# (Questie-Forever 1.0.6, as Polestar 0.2.5 shipped); the book items from the
# Forever client 1.60.1.70450 (ItemSparse: every book is a unique, soulbound
# item "a fine addition to any library's collection"). Where the books lie,
# and how many books Friend of the Library asks for, come from a fan list
# compiled on 2026-10-17 from beta guides (Zockify, Method, forg.gg,
# Warcraft Tavern); only books several of them confirm in Forever are here.
# Not play-tested with Polestar yet: refine the spots with Polestar_Recorder
# sessions.
#
# Left out:
# - Sanguine Sorcery, Venomous Journeys, A Mind of Metal, Stonewrought
#   Design, Conjurer's Codex, Necromancy 101, Undead Potatoes, A Study of
#   the Light, Scourge: Undead Menace or Misunderstood?, The Knight and the
#   Lady, The Liminal and the Arcane, Legends of the Tidesages, Everyday
#   Etiquette, Northern Kalimdor, Ka-Boom!, Magma or Lava?, A Luddite's
#   Guide and Ataeric: On Arcane Curiosities: not confirmed in Forever yet
#   (Season of Discovery spots, or guides disagree).
# - The Dalaran Digest, Vol. 23 (Silverpine) and Nar'thalas Almanac, Vol. 74
#   (Darkshore): confirmed, but our data has no quest for them yet.
# - Archmage Antonidas: The Unabridged Autobiography lies in Ironforge, and
#   Archmage Theocritus' Research Journal and Runes of the Sorcerer-Kings are
#   Alliance quests: the Alliance guide has them.
# - Greater Friend of the Library: our data has only the Alliance quests
#   (79536, 82208, from Garion Wendell).

step The Apothecary's Metaphysical Primer
  tip Brill's alchemy shop: the primer sits on the corner shelf next to Apothecary Johaan.
  collect 208185

step Owen Thadd
  zone Undercity
  tip Owen Thadd, in the Magic Quarter's inner ring, takes the library books: each one is a quest he offers while the book is in your bags.
  accept 79095
  turnin 79095 npc 211022

step The Lessons of Ta'zo
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The Valley of Spirits: the Mural of Ta'zo tablet near Darkbriar Lodge.
  collect 207972 "The Lessons of Ta'zo" @38.7,78.4

step Baxtan: On Destructive Magics
  zone The Barrens
  tip Ratchet's engineering shop: upstairs, next to Gazlowe.
  collect 208800 @62.7,36.3

step Arcanic Systems Manual
  tip The Sludge Fen oil rig in the far north of the Barrens: the manual lies on the chair behind Supervisor Lugwizzle in the control room.
  collect 209847 @56.3,8.8

step Secrets of the Dreamers
  tip The cave in the hills above the Lushwater Oasis leads into the Cavern of Mists, outside the Wailing Caverns instance: the scrolls lie by a double column of rock. The point is the cave mouth.
  collect 209846 @46.0,36.5

step Fury of the Land
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Grimtotem Post in the south-east of Stonetalon: the scrolls lie on a barrel in the smaller hut.
  collect 209851 @74.4,85.7

step Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works
  zone Westfall
  tip Sentinel Hill's inn, an Alliance town: the book lies on the table behind the innkeeper. Loch Modan's Thelsamar inn has another copy, deeper in Alliance land.
  collect 208860 @52.7,53.8

step Bewitchments and Glamours
  tip Moonbrook, in the south of Westfall: on the bookshelf of the first house on the left, the one with the yellow roof.
  collect 209845 @45.4,70.5

step Crimes Against Anatomy
  zone Duskwood
  tip The crypt in Raven Hill Cemetery leads down into the catacombs; the book lies on the alchemy table in the last room. The undead there are level 27-28 and packed close.
  collect 209849 @16.7,28.5

step Goaz Scrolls
  zone Wetlands
  tip Whelgar's Excavation Site: the scrolls are inside an urn on the lowest level of the dig.
  collect 209848 @33.6,47.9

step Geomancy: The Stone-Cold Truth
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Darkcloud Pinnacle: the path up starts near 31,37; the book is inside the largest Grimtotem hut on top.
  collect 215683 @34.4,40.0

