step Defensive Magics 101
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Gallows' Corner, the ogre fortress in Alterac's middle: the book is inside the first tower.
  collect 215815 @48.4,57.6

step A Web of Lies: Debunking Myths and Legends
  zone Arathi Highlands
  tip Witherbark Village in the south-east of Arathi: on the east side, just outside a hut.
  collect 215816 @73.6,65.2

step Basilisks: Should Petrification be Feared?
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Crystalvein Mine: the notes lie on the wooden platform right of the entrance.
  collect 213165

step Mummies: A Guide to the Unsavory Undead
  zone Badlands
  tip The crypt on the south side of the butte, by the skeletons; the path up starts near 56,45.
  collect 215820 @56.7,39.7

step RwlRwlRwlRwl!
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The murloc camp below Witch Hill: on the ground by the furnace at its east edge.
  collect 215822 @57.1,20.8

step Demons and You
  zone Desolace
  tip Thunder Axe Fortress: the book lies on a bench inside the large inner building.
  collect 215817 "Demons and You" @55.1,26.2

